20:42.000 --> 20:43.540
Go to the large body!

20:43.540 --> 20:46.010
Combine to form Great Titan!

20:46.010 --> 20:47.420
<i>Roger that.</i>

20:48.470 --> 20:50.250
Alchemy in!

20:50.900 --> 20:52.310
<i>Roger!</i>

