20:54.900 --> 20:57.000
It's perfect!

20:57.000 --> 20:59.830
This could even defeat a dragon!

20:59.830 --> 21:01.660
Shall we try challenging a dungeon?!

21:01.900 --> 21:05.450
<i>I think this might be happiness!</i>

21:05.670 --> 21:08.320
You really let your tastes run wild there.

21:08.320 --> 21:09.410
Lady Nolyn.

21:09.720 --> 21:11.480
There's something concerning.

21:11.480 --> 21:15.000
We've started seeing traces 
of Anat's existence.

21:15.820 --> 21:18.450
Even though she shouldn't exist at all?

21:18.790 --> 21:22.840
We believe it's the influence of many years 
of faith from the Church of Divine Light.

21:23.190 --> 21:24.110
Also...

21:24.510 --> 21:26.920
She's on the verge of 
becoming an evil spirit.

21:26.920 --> 21:28.160
An evil spirit...

21:28.830 --> 21:34.480
Given that the Holy Empire of Sidonia
was behind that hero summoning,

21:34.480 --> 21:36.900
I think we'll see war
on the main continent.

21:37.510 --> 21:39.060
I'm sure we will.

21:39.060 --> 21:40.150
Lady Nolyn?

21:40.650 --> 21:44.360
Though, I can't interfere directly.

21:44.620 --> 21:46.160
I understand.

21:46.160 --> 21:48.000
So your plan...

21:48.600 --> 21:53.130
That's why you created that boy's body and 
gave him such an extravagant blessing?

21:53.580 --> 21:55.340
That Takumi Iruma?

21:55.340 --> 21:58.170
It's all up to Takumi now.

22:04.310 --> 22:07.350
Soon, the time will be ripe.
